<div class="g-prose"><p>Every icon renders with <code>aria-hidden="true"</code>. A button holding only an icon needs an <code>aria-label</code>; a button with text needs nothing more. The five <code>severity-*</code> glyphs are the signal tiers; render them through the <a href="/signals/signal/">signal</a> macro so the tier's colour comes with them.</p></div>

